  "sourceBehavior": [
    "An exact world context starts a thread-local frame value containing renderer, clock generation, replay seconds, unscaled replay delta and next caller role",
    "Only the three approved exact E8 return sites consume the frame state, in total/delta/world order",
    "Every role rechecks the live controlled primary renderer, generation, replay timestamp and existing renderer timeline",
    "The total role retains the existing native epoch mapping",
    "The delta role substitutes the finite nonnegative unscaled replay delta; a held timestamp contributes zero",
    "Native code retains double-to-float narrowing, multiplication, accumulator update, hour wrap and conditional skip",
    "The conditional world role records the original remainder return and performs no world-phase override; its following store is not claimed observed",
    "Recognized invalid/out-of-order roles clear authority; unrelated math calls retain their native result without consuming the frame state",
    "A new world context or context output/return mismatch replaces or clears frame authority"
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Current-build candidates are not enabled by this port",
    "The initial native total/world shader phases are not yet selected from an archived replay clock track",
    "Different fresh/reconstructed worlds are not proven to start at the same shader phase",
    "Conditional world accumulation need not execute every frame",
    "No GPU upload, full world shader coverage, native cosmetics insertion, complete replay scene or MP4 equivalence is proved"
  ],
